06/08/2025 16:22:41 - Adrian Fish (Work notes)
Hello Jason,
 
I’m reaching out to provide you with an update on your case CS1621666.
 
I believe the trust where asked to send the 'Copy to' reports the same way as they do the existing Radiology reports.  Keystone appears to be looking for the partner details in ORC 21.3, where the trust send us the national code, so as long as the trust output the 'Copy to' practice national code into ORC 21.3 and is sent down the same route as the existing Radiology, then Keystone shouldn't require any changes.

Are the reports getting to the Keystone server in the first instance? e.g. are they sending down the same IP/Port as the existing Radiology?  If so, is the code the trust want to send the report to in ORC 21.3?
 
If you have any questions or need further clarification, please don’t hesitate to reply to this email.
 
Kind regards,
Adrian

