18/11/2025 17:06:33 - Astha Agnihotri (Work notes)
Step 1: Update Catalogue 

Log in to the Test Environment.
Navigate to Practice Management and select the practice where you want to make the change.
From the list of users, select the specific user and click Modify.
In the Modify Practice User dialog box, go to the Catalogues tab.
Under Available Catalogues, locate All Radiology and click Add.
Ensure All Radiology appears in the Assigned Catalogues section along with existing catalogues.
Click Save to apply the changes.


Step 2: Update Orderables for Radiology


Locate the Radiology exam codes (e.g., CT, MRI, Ultrasound, Nuclear Medicine).
Modify these codes to make them common orderables as required.
Click Save to confirm the changes.

