This message originated from outside of NHS.net Connect. Please do not click links or open attachments unless you recognise the sender and know the content is safe.
Ajith,
 
Your testing of CDS v6.3 OPA files was not successful as you only submitted three files, OPA_20250701_20250705.CSV, OPA_20250701_20250705_V1.CSV & OPA_20250701_20250702.CSV, all of which failed.
 
You must continue to use ""submit for manual inspection\CDS"" directory to submit OPA files until such time that we can prove that your OPA CDS V6.3 submissions are being successfully processed.
 
____________________
 
