01/12/2025 11:12:18 - Arfan Mohammad (Work notes)
Script used to get  12 month of tQuest requests per practice.

SELECT
    p.[name] AS [Practice Name],
    COUNT(DISTINCT r.requestID) AS [Request Count]
FROM tquest.dbo.practice AS p
JOIN tquest.dbo.practiceuser AS pu
    ON pu.practiceID = p.practiceID
JOIN tquest.dbo.request AS r
    ON r.practiceID = p.practiceID
WHERE
    p.active = 1
    AND pu.active = 1
    AND r.created >= DATEADD(YEAR, -1, GETDATE())
GROUP BY
    p.[name]
ORDER BY
    [Request Count] DESC

