Hi Andrea,


Thank you providing the screenshot. It confirms that the connection is being blocked. The next step is to contact your IT team and have them allow the connection through the firewall. Once that is done, you should be able to proceed without any issues.
Please ensure that outbound traffic to port 22 is allowed for the hostname cds-xfer.sftp.cds-health.uk, or alternatively, create a proxy bypass rule for cds-xfer.sftp.cds-health.uk on port 22. This configuration is required for CDS data submission.

Kind regards,
