"CS1705343","Salisbury NHS Foundation Trust","4 - Low","16/12/2025 13:47:05","Closed","Info tab - report required","20/04/2026 16:34:48","mariana.tudorache@nhs.net","Acute OCM Support Level 1","Arfan Mohammad","20/04/2026 11:46:56 - Arfan Mohammad (Work notes)
Script to retreive the info tab data,

SELECT 
o.orderableID,
o.[description] as 'Description',
t.[text] AS Info
FROM orderable o 
JOIN orderableguideline og  ON o.orderableId = og.orderableId
JOIN [text] t     ON og.textID = t.textID
WHERE o.active = 1
ORDER BY o.orderableID DESC

