Endpoints
What is the customer trying to do?
Which GP Connect feature is being used?
(e.g. Booking an appointment, Saving a consultation, Accessing a patient record)
Is this the only feature affected?
Are other actions (like saving consultations or accessing records) also having issues?
Are other features working normally?
For example, if booking appointments is failing, is saving consultations still working fine?

Response Time/Slowness Issues
 Is the endpoint slow to respond?
 Is this slowness issue happening right now (ongoing)?
 Is the issue intermittent?
 If intermittent, when does it occur?
 What response times are observed during these periods?

Error Responses
 Is the endpoint returning an error?
 Is the error happening right now (ongoing)?
 Is the error intermittent?
 What are the exact error messages, codes, or responses?

Add to KB providing DataDog Dash - Partner API Service Dash England
 Monitoring & Evidence
 Provide monitoring data (charts, logs, tables, spreadsheets).
 Ensure data covers the full duration of the issue.
 Include multiple examples, not just one-off cases.


