As previously communicated, the AWS CDS Test environment is not yet available, which means there is currently no capability for submitting any TEST files. For this reason, no form of test activity can be carried out at this time.

Please NOTE that the Validate_Only directory within CDS_v6.3_Validate_Only is part of the Production system and must never be used for test submissions under any circumstances. Test files in this location can severely impact system performance and, as we experienced recently, can cause significant disruption.

Once the AWS CDS Test environment becomes available, we will notify all relevant teams so appropriate testing can be carried out safely.

If you have production-ready files to process and require actions within the current environment, please let me know and I'll be happy to assist.

