The SMTP Mailer is failing because Keystone is still using TLS 1.1, and TLS 1.2+ has been made mandatory. Since TLS 1.1 is now obsolete and no longer supported, the SMTP Mailer will continue to fail until Keystone is updated to use a supported TLS version.

