Rule 949110 is

It's the rule that causes the request to be blocked if the 'anomaly score' (set by other rules) exceeds the threshold.

Which actual rule (or rules) is being broken (to set the score)?

It will actually be one (or more?) of the rules in

REQUEST-942-APPLICATION-ATTACK-SQLI

