10/04/2026 11:32:56 - Arfan Mohammad (Work notes)
SQL query to get the Extract of Protocols & questions 

SELECT 
qTextScreen as 'Text on Screen Question', 
qTextPrint as 'Text on Print Question' , 
qCode as 'Code',
[Name] as 'Protocol Name',
[description] as 'Protocol Description'
FROM question q
JOIN questionprotocollink qpl ON q.qID = qpl.qID
JOIN protocol p ON qpl.protocolID = p.protocolID
where q.active = 1
order by q.qTextScreen

