Hello Mariana,
 
I’m reaching out to provide you with an update on your case CS1820517.
 
The Review application should allow you to action this request by following the steps below:-

1) Load the Review application
2) Search for Patient ID 0764775 and press find
3) Select the Patients tab
4) Find the patient record that you want to edit, and select full patient summary (Screenshot attached to show the icon I am referring to)
5) Just under the NHS number on the right hand side of the screen, you will see two arrows pointing down, please select that icon
6) Now you will see a section called Primary ID, here you have the ability to remove the patient ID

If you have any questions or need further clarification, please don’t hesitate to reply to this email.
 
Kind regards,
Adrian

